From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Desidero <desidero@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 04:16:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(web): bring palette new chat in project up to its PR

Typing "project" also reaches the New chat in <project> rows, and the
feature map documents the palette rows, matching
https://github.com/omnigent-ai/omnigent/pull/11394.

Signed-off-by: Desidero <desidero@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 feature-map/composer.md               | 24 +++++++++++-------------
 web/src/shell/CommandPalette.test.tsx | 18 ++++++++++++++++++
 web/src/shell/CommandPalette.tsx      |  8 ++++----
 3 files changed, 33 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

